<component id="ID_s1_title">
<text><![CDATA[<b>Langkah Konfigurasi NAT Dinamis</b>]]></text>
</component>

<!--screen 1 table -->

<component id="ID_s1_table01">
<text><![CDATA[<table bordercolor="#98D3D1" borderwidth="3" cellpadding="4" glow="true" glowcolor="#808080" header="none" shadow="false" shadowcolor="#000000">
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#98D3D1" class="title" colspan="2"><font color="#1C3635" size="11"><b>Langkah Konfigurasi NAT Dinamis</b></font></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#0E6360" class="mtable_top" colspan="2"><font color="#434321" size="1"><span style="color:#DAE17A">.</span></font></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#eff8f7" valign="top" width="50"><font color="#393536"><b>Langkah 1</b></font></td>
<td bgcolor="#eff8f7" valign="top"><font color="#393536">Define a pool of global addresses to be used for translation.<br/><font face="_typewriter"><b>kolam ip nat</b> <i>nama awal-ip akhir-ip</i><br/>{<b>netmask</b><i>netmask</i> | <b>panjang awalan</b><i>panjang awalan</i>}</font></font></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" valign="top"><font color="#393536"><b>Langkah 2</b></font></td>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" valign="top"><font color="#393536">Configure a standard access list permitting the addresses that should be translated.<br/><font face="_typewriter"><b>daftar akses</b> <i>nomor daftar akses</i> <b>izin</b> <i>sumber</i> [<i>sumber-wildcard</i>]</font></font></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#eff8f7" valign="top"><font color="#393536"><b>Langkah 3</b></font></td>
<td bgcolor="#eff8f7" valign="top"><font color="#393536">Establish dynamic source translation, specifying the access list and pool defined in prior steps.<br/><font face="_typewriter"><b>ip nat di dalam daftar sumber</b> <i>nomor daftar akses</i> <b>kolam</b> <i>nama</i></font></font></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" valign="top"><font color="#393536"><b>Langkah 4</b></font></td>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" valign="top"><font color="#393536">Identify the inside interface.<br/><font face="_typewriter"><b>antarmuka</b> <i>ketik nomor</i><br/> <b>ip nat di dalam</b></font></font></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#eff8f7" valign="top"><font color="#393536"><b>Langkah 5</b></font></td>
<td bgcolor="#eff8f7" valign="top"><font color="#393536">Identify the outside interface.<br/><font face="_typewriter"><b>antarmuka</b> <i>ketik nomor</i><br/> <b>ip nat di luar</b></font></font></td>
</tr>
</table>]]></text> 
</component>

<!--screen2-->
<component id="ID_s2_title">
<text><![CDATA[<b>Contoh Konfigurasi NAT Dinamis</b>]]></text>
</component>
<component id="ID_s2_txt01">
  <text><![CDATA[<b>Jaringan Dalam</b>]]></text> 
  </component>
<component id="ID_s2_txt02">
  <text><![CDATA[<b>Jaringan Luar</b>]]></text> 
  </component>
  <component id="ID_s2_txt03">
  <text><![CDATA[Internet]]></text> 
  </component>
   <component id="ID_s2_txt04">
  <text><![CDATA[<b>Terjemahan Satu-ke-Satu</b>]]></text> 
  </component>
   <component id="ID_s2_txt05">
  <text><![CDATA[<b>Dinamis NAT</b>]]></text> 
  </component>
  
   <component id="ID_s2_txt06">
  <text><![CDATA[pelayan]]></text> 
  </component>
  
   <component id="ID_s2_txt07" fontFace='Courier New' fontSize="10">
  <text><![CDATA[<pre class="margin-top"><font face="Arial" size="10">Defines a pool of public IPv4 addresses under the pool name NAT-POOL1.</font><br class="linespacing"/>
R2(config)# <font face="_typewriter"><b>ip nat pool NAT-POOL1 209.165.200.226<br/>209.165.200.240 masker jaring 255.255.255.224</b></font><br/>
<font face="Arial" size="10">Defines which addresses are eligible to be translated.</font><br class="linespacing"/>
<font face="_typewriter">R2(config)# <b>daftar akses 1 izin 192.168.0.0 0.0.255.255</b></font><br/>
<font face="Arial" size="10">Binds NAT-POOL1 with ACL 1.</font><br class="linespacing"/>
<font face="_typewriter">R2(config)# <b>ip nat di dalam daftar sumber 1 kumpulan NAT-POOL1</b></font><br/>
<font face="Arial" size="10">Identifies interface serial 0/0/0 as an inside NAT interface.</font><br/>
<font face="_typewriter">R2(config)# <b>antarmuka Serial0/0/0</b></font><br class="linespacing"/>
<font face="_typewriter">R2(config-if)# <b>ip nat di dalam</b></font><br/>
<font face="Arial" size="10">Identifies interface serial 0/1/0 as an outside NAT interface.</font><br class="linespacing"/>
<font face="_typewriter">R2(config)# <b>antarmuka Serial0/1/0</b></font><br class="linespacing"/>
<font face="_typewriter">R2(config-if)# <b>ip nat di luar</b></font></pre>]]></text> 
</component>
 




